{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaayvurenda/quests_cartilla_tile

    One tile of the box of squares: its drawing, its name and how many books fill it (few, in red); touched, it goes to
    the next free place of the card, or back to the box when it is in it. Its form is the table's, outside it: the
    example goes without it, as a tile alone has no table.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "spec": "corner:5", "label": "Ciencias", "art": "https://example.com/rincon-5.webp",
        "in": true, "at": 1, "value": "", "few": false, "count": "512 libros", "off": false,
        "cartillaincard": "En la cartilla"
    }
}}
<button class="ayv-ct-ficha" type="submit"{{#form}} form="{{form}}"{{/form}} name="squares[{{at}}]" value="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#in}}true{{/in}}{{^in}}false{{/in}}"{{#off}} disabled{{/off}}>{{#art}}<img class="ayv-ct-ficha-dibujo" src="{{art}}" alt="" width="512" height="512">{{/art}}<span class="ayv-ct-ficha-n">{{label}}</span><span class="ayv-ct-ficha-c{{#few}} ayv-ct-pocos{{/few}}">{{count}}</span>{{#in}}<span class="ayv-ct-ficha-en">{{cartillaincard}}</span>{{/in}}</button>
